<title>JAPAN: TOA sets terms on 50mln SF warrant.</title>
<headline>TOA sets terms on 50mln SF warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - TOA Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR -</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Tokyo-Mitsubishi Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO		AMT   50 million Sfr</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 31.Jul.01</p>
<p> EXER PRICE 759 yen   CURR RATE 79.35/Sfr</p>
<p> EXER FROM 14.Aug.97  EXER TO 24.Jul.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 31.Jul.97  INT PAY 31.Jul</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 17.Jul.97 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon will be decided on July 17.</p>
</text>
